  "h1": "Exhibition stand design and construction in Alicante",
  "introText": "We design and build exhibition stands for IFA – Fira Alacant (Elche) from start to finish: design, in-house manufacturing, assembly and dismantling with a single point of contact. 3D prototype in 72h, venue technical documentation, coverage across Spain and Portugal and the Audited Project guarantee. Regular presence at Futurmoda, Firauto and Alicante Gastronómica.",
  "body": "\n        <h2>Exhibition stand design and construction in Alicante: one provider, no subcontracting</h2>\n        <p>At <strong>Standarte</strong> we design and build your <strong>stand for IFA – Fira Alacant (Elche)</strong> from start to finish: design, in-house manufacturing in our <strong>own workshop</strong>, transport, assembly and dismantling. A <strong>single point of contact</strong> for the whole project, with no subcontractors or middlemen, more than <strong>20 years of experience</strong> and a regular presence at Alicante's major events —<a href=\"/en/ferias/futurmoda-elche\">Futurmoda</a>, <a href=\"/en/ferias/firauto-elche\">Firauto</a> and <a href=\"/en/ferias/alicante-gastronomica\">Alicante Gastronómica</a>. Because we control every stage internally, deadlines are firmer and the finish you approve is exactly what is built in the hall.</p>\n\n        <h2>How we build your stand in Alicante, step by step</h2>\n        <ol>\n          <li><strong>Briefing and objectives.</strong> We understand your brand, your product and your goals at the fair to size the space and the investment.</li>\n          <li><strong>Design and 3D prototype in 72h.</strong> We engineer the stand with high-fidelity 3D software and deliver a photorealistic prototype so you can validate every detail before anything is built.</li>\n          <li><strong>Validation with the <a href=\"/en/audited-project\">Audited Project</a> system.</strong> Every approval —design, quote and changes— is recorded in a verifiable, archivable file: our 100&nbsp;% guarantee that what is built is what you approved.</li>\n          <li><strong>In-house manufacturing.</strong> We produce the custom carpentry, furniture and graphics under artisan-level quality control.</li>\n          <li><strong>Transport and assembly.</strong> Our own fitters and carpenters raise the stand with the pre-fabrication completed 24&nbsp;h before the opening.</li>\n          <li><strong>Dismantling.</strong> We remove the stand once the event closes so you don't have to deal with a thing.</li>\n        </ol>\n\n        <h2>Types of stand we build in Alicante</h2>\n        <ul>\n          <li><strong>Modular stand</strong>: fast and reusable, ideal for recurring appearances at IFA – Fira Alacant.</li>\n          <li><strong>Custom stand</strong>: unique design in premium carpentry, tailored to your space.</li>\n          <li><strong>Premium and double-decker stand</strong>: high impact, mezzanine, meeting rooms and VIP areas.</li>\n          <li><strong>Island and corner stand</strong>: optimal use of space depending on your location at the venue.</li>\n          <li><strong>Audiovisual integration</strong>: low-consumption LED lighting, screens and multimedia.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <p>How much does a stand in Alicante cost? With our <strong>instant calculation based on square metres</strong> you get a price forecast for a premium-category stand in seconds. Check the price bands and calculate your investment on <a href=\"/en/prices\">stand prices</a>.</p>\n\n        <h2>Technical documentation of the IFA – Fira Alacant venue (Elche)</h2>\n        <p><strong>IFA – Fira Alacant</strong>, in Elche, is the trade-fair institution of the Alicante province: it organises more than twenty commercial fairs and numerous congresses that draw over <strong>300,000 visitors</strong> and <strong>2,000 companies</strong> a year. Its halls host sectors as diverse as footwear, automotive, gastronomy, beauty and home, with room for modular stands, large-format islands and double-decker builds.</p>\n        <p>We master the technical documentation IFA requires: electrical and water connection requests, certified projects for work at height, activity coordination plans and the <strong>fire-reaction certificates</strong> for timber and textiles. We submit all documentation to the venue's technical office and leave the stand assembled and checked 24&nbsp;h before the opening.</p>\n\n        <h2>Fairs and sectors in Alicante (IFA)</h2>\n        <p>Alicante is a major economic engine of the south-east and we build across the IFA – Fira Alacant calendar —each name links to its fair because we genuinely cover it—: <a href=\"/en/ferias/futurmoda-elche\">Futurmoda</a> (<a href=\"/en/actividad/moda-textil\">footwear and leather components</a>), the great salon of Europe's main shoemaking cluster; <a href=\"/en/ferias/firauto-elche\">Firauto</a> (<a href=\"/en/actividad/automocion\">automotive</a>); and <a href=\"/en/ferias/alicante-gastronomica\">Alicante Gastronómica</a> (<a href=\"/en/actividad/gastronomia-hosteleria\">gastronomy and hospitality</a>). That every one of them appears linked is proof of real coverage no local competitor can demonstrate.</p>\n\n        <h2>The widest coverage in Iberia: Alicante, Spain and Portugal</h2>\n        <p>Standarte offers the <strong>widest Iberian coverage</strong> with the <strong>same builder</strong> and the <strong>same quality standards</strong>. In the Valencian Community and the south-east we also build in <a href=\"/en/stand_design_assembly_valencia\">Valencia</a> and <a href=\"/en/stand_design_assembly_murcia\">Murcia</a>, and go up with the same reliability to <a href=\"/en/stand_design_assembly_madrid\">Madrid</a> and <a href=\"/en/stand_design_assembly_barcelona\">Barcelona</a>, plus Portugal (<a href=\"/en/stand_design_assembly_lisbon\">Lisbon</a> and <a href=\"/en/stand_design_assembly_porto\">Porto</a>). This Iberian network is an asset no local provider can match.</p>\n\n        <h2>Pat, your free trade-fair advisor</h2>\n        <p>Even before designing the stand, <strong>Pat</strong> —our interactive advisor— recommends the key fairs and congresses for your sector in Spain and Portugal and prepares your request in a minute. A free, exclusive advisory service to get the events where you exhibit right. <a href=\"/en\">Talk to Pat</a> from the home page.</p>\n\n        <h2>100&nbsp;% guarantee: the Audited Project system</h2>\n        <p>Every project is recorded in a verifiable, archivable file —3D prototype, quote and approvals— that acts as a witness to the agreement and guarantees that exactly what you approve is built, with no surprises. It's our own trust tool: discover the <a href=\"/en/audited-project\">Audited Project system</a>.</p>\n\n        <h2>Assembly logistics at IFA – Fira Alacant</h2>\n        <p>IFA has wide vehicle access right up to the halls that eases unloading and assembly, with excellent connections to the A-7 and Alicante-Elche airport. We coordinate transport, full pre-fabrication in the workshop and a clean, punctual set-up. Calculate your investment instantly on <a href=\"/en/prices\">stand prices</a>.</p>\n\n        <h2>Why choose Standarte for your stand in Alicante</h2>\n        <p>More than 20 years of experience, our own workshop, a portfolio of over <a href=\"/en/#prototipos-3d\">136 3D projects</a> and an average rating of 4.9/5. We bring together what local competitors don't offer as a package: <strong>3D prototype in 72&nbsp;h</strong>, <strong>instant price calculation per m²</strong>, <strong>Audited Project guarantee</strong>, Pat's advice and the <strong>widest coverage in Spain and Portugal</strong>. With Standarte your brand conveys solidity, technical quality and full commercial commitment in Alicante.</p>\n        <p><strong>Request your quote within 24&nbsp;h</strong> or calculate your stand instantly on <a href=\"/en/prices\">prices</a>. We design, manufacture and build your stand at IFA – Fira Alacant with a single call.</p>\n      ",
